<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $61-5/8(FIM 308.61).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $61-5/8(FIM 308.61).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed $2-3/8 lower at $61-5/8 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 308.61 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed down four markka at 315.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $0-1/8 at $36-7/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 92.33 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.70 markka at 93.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended $0-1/8 lower at $23 in New York on Friday. The price equals about 115.18 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Rauma closed down 0.50 markka at 117.00.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
